WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.470 --> 01:46.850
=Episode 23=

01:54.590 --> 01:55.590
I've seen this...

01:58.200 --> 01:59.720
Can Zhu Yu absorb the Qiyuan Orb

02:00.070 --> 02:01.150
like Miss Yue?

02:02.430 --> 02:03.670
Apart from Little Yue,

02:04.230 --> 02:05.720
the only one who can do it is...

02:06.640 --> 02:07.280
Lord Ming.

02:14.750 --> 02:16.280
Yue, what should we do?

02:17.000 --> 02:18.070
Let's go to Lin Yuan.

02:19.550 --> 02:20.360
He's an upright person.

02:20.960 --> 02:22.160
Perhaps he will tell us something.

02:23.640 --> 02:25.390
Shifang, you wait here for Qi.

02:26.360 --> 02:27.120
Yue.

02:32.190 --> 02:32.870
May I help you?

02:34.590 --> 02:35.120
Mr. Lin.

02:35.390 --> 02:37.840
Zhu Yun is Lord Ming, yes?

02:42.550 --> 02:43.750
You saw the soul fish, didn't you?

02:50.150 --> 02:52.510
Yes, Her Lordship is Lord Ming.

02:53.720 --> 02:55.870
How is the Sea of Clear Skies related
to the Qiyuan Sect?

02:57.760 --> 02:58.790
How did you know?

03:00.230 --> 03:01.550
It seems there is a connection.

03:02.960 --> 03:04.150
Qi has already recorded everything

03:04.150 --> 03:05.000
about the Yujie Hub.

03:06.190 --> 03:07.510
Since she is your young lord,

03:08.320 --> 03:10.110
why did you send her to the Yujie Hub?

03:12.190 --> 03:13.400
It's a long story.

03:14.720 --> 03:16.720
That's okay. We have time for that.

03:20.230 --> 03:22.760
Okay, come with me.

03:45.910 --> 03:47.280
I just want the truth.

03:52.910 --> 03:56.280
Are you ready to face the harsh truth?

03:57.280 --> 03:58.110
Go ahead.

04:07.880 --> 04:09.720
It's a very long story.

04:10.640 --> 04:10.950
Come.

04:20.240 --> 04:21.360
The Sea of Clear Skies

04:21.950 --> 04:23.750
was far more beautiful
and prosperous than it is now.

04:30.080 --> 04:31.160
Until that disaster.

04:32.950 --> 04:33.550
What disaster?

04:55.670 --> 04:56.640
Right after the disaster,

04:57.520 --> 04:58.390
we came to know

05:00.440 --> 05:01.550
that for over a hundred years,

05:02.390 --> 05:04.910
we have always been living
on the back of Kun.

05:07.600 --> 05:08.440
Sadly,

05:10.670 --> 05:11.310
Kun woke up.

05:19.800 --> 05:20.360
Kun

05:22.190 --> 05:22.720
is Zhu Yun.

05:34.470 --> 05:35.390
In its lifetime,

05:36.280 --> 05:37.470
Kun must be evolved.

05:38.640 --> 05:39.880
And its process will be painful

05:41.310 --> 05:43.159
and deadly due to drastic changes

05:43.159 --> 05:45.000
in a short period.

05:47.520 --> 05:50.159
The Mist Soul can delay the time.

05:51.190 --> 05:51.830
Therefore,

05:52.750 --> 05:53.600
for generations,

05:54.550 --> 05:56.720
they have relied on the Mist Soul
to slow down time,

05:57.360 --> 05:59.159
delaying the process of evolution

05:59.280 --> 06:00.480
to lessen the suffering.

06:05.320 --> 06:06.790
But when I was going to be evolved,

06:08.200 --> 06:09.070
I discovered

06:09.790 --> 06:11.670
that the Yu Clan lived right on my back.

06:13.950 --> 06:15.350
And my evolution

06:16.480 --> 06:17.630
almost caused a catastrophe

06:18.830 --> 06:20.350
for the Yu Clan.

06:21.390 --> 06:23.600
I couldn't watch the Yu Clan perish.

06:24.830 --> 06:25.390
So,

06:27.070 --> 06:30.230
while using the Mist Soul
to slow down the evolution,

06:31.070 --> 06:35.159
I drew spiritual power
from the Nine Springs to heal the Yu Clan.

06:38.040 --> 06:38.760
But in that case,

06:39.280 --> 06:40.480
the Spring Vein will be unbalanced,

06:40.950 --> 06:42.440
causing a catastrophe in the Six Realms.

06:42.440 --> 06:43.600
You're right.

06:44.790 --> 06:45.920
Although it gets unbalanced,

06:46.510 --> 06:47.830
it will soon recover.

06:49.760 --> 06:50.440
Really?

06:51.320 --> 06:52.320
I heard from Mr. Gu

06:53.000 --> 06:55.040
that it takes over 100 years
for the Spring Vein to recover.

06:57.920 --> 06:58.440
Qi.

07:00.510 --> 07:01.390
We are Kun.

07:02.280 --> 07:03.720
A hundred years is merely

07:04.000 --> 07:05.920
one-thousandth the lifespan of Kun.

07:08.230 --> 07:09.510
But for humans,

07:10.200 --> 07:11.950
100 years is the length of a lifetime.

07:19.230 --> 07:20.160
Honestly,

07:23.480 --> 07:26.440
Ying Xuwei said the same as you.

07:41.070 --> 07:41.920
The key ring lit up.

07:44.040 --> 07:45.830
Is there a hole of spring here?

07:49.670 --> 07:50.200
Yes.

07:52.510 --> 07:53.720
It's the Mist Soul.

07:55.440 --> 07:56.390
Right there.

07:57.820 --> 08:00.330
(Mist Soul inside the Core
of the Demon Realm)

08:00.670 --> 08:01.960
Whenever I see a hole of spring,

08:02.480 --> 08:04.600
I'm always amazed
by the wonders of creation.

08:06.160 --> 08:06.790
We Yu Clan

08:07.830 --> 08:09.630
should have been wiped out
in the last calamity.

08:11.950 --> 08:14.110
Our queen, Ling Ye,
used her last bit of strength

08:14.600 --> 08:16.110
to stop the ascension of Kun.

08:18.110 --> 08:18.670
And then,

08:19.670 --> 08:21.630
Kun took Ling Ye's corporeal form

08:22.510 --> 08:23.600
and became the new lord.

08:36.720 --> 08:37.440
Who are they?

08:39.230 --> 08:39.720
Well,

08:41.830 --> 08:43.200
they're severely injured clansmen

08:43.549 --> 08:44.510
in the last calamity.

08:47.110 --> 08:48.830
Her Lordship has been healing them,

08:49.630 --> 08:50.920
hoping that one day

08:52.280 --> 08:53.600
they will wake up.

08:55.110 --> 08:56.000
They look

08:57.200 --> 08:58.070
like humans.

09:09.950 --> 09:10.480
I see.

09:12.480 --> 09:13.320
Because of the Mist Soul,

09:14.510 --> 09:16.320
you established a connection
with the Hengdao Sect.

09:17.510 --> 09:18.510
Ying Xuwei.

09:19.720 --> 09:21.350
You have a connection
with the Hengdao Sect.

09:25.790 --> 09:27.350
During the Bloodbinding
of the Mist Soul,

09:27.720 --> 09:29.000
(Ying Xuwei found me.)

09:29.720 --> 09:32.040
(He advised me to use the Mist Soul)

09:32.630 --> 09:35.070
to lead the Yu Clan
into the time stasis.

09:36.440 --> 09:37.670
Time stasis?

09:39.200 --> 09:40.550
Does it mean to lock you up?

09:41.830 --> 09:42.630
Pretty much.

09:43.760 --> 09:46.630
He'd put us in a place
where time nearly stopped.

09:47.440 --> 09:50.070
Then they would find ways
to heal the Yu Clan.

09:50.920 --> 09:51.760
What happened after that?

09:54.670 --> 09:57.350
Later, we reached an agreement.

09:59.040 --> 10:01.630
They would gather enough Vitality Energy
to heal the Yu Clan.

10:01.630 --> 10:02.950
After the Yu Clan was healed,

10:03.280 --> 10:05.830
I would break the Bloodbinding
of the Mist Soul.

10:09.070 --> 10:10.480
Vitality Energy?

10:13.110 --> 10:13.920
Could it be...?

10:16.240 --> 10:17.040
- Well...
- That's right.

10:19.190 --> 10:20.070
Ying Xuwei

10:21.160 --> 10:24.280
(found and supported a small sect
in the Mortal Realm.)

10:25.630 --> 10:26.720
(He sent them)

10:27.240 --> 10:28.560
(to search for the Qiyuan Orb.)

10:28.920 --> 10:30.950
(So I could absorb the Vitality Energy)

10:30.990 --> 10:32.070
(to heal the Yu Clan.)

10:34.600 --> 10:35.190
(Zhu Yu.)

10:36.830 --> 10:37.600
Turns out

10:39.190 --> 10:40.430
you really are Lord Ming.

10:44.190 --> 10:45.600
You harmed so many people.

10:46.430 --> 10:48.430
You sacrificed the lives
of so many humans.

10:48.430 --> 10:49.360
But I have no choice.

10:49.360 --> 10:51.870
I can't watch the Yu Clan perish.

10:52.040 --> 10:53.190
The lives of the Yu Clan matter.

10:53.510 --> 10:55.190
Don't the lives of humans matter too?

11:01.750 --> 11:02.950
Everything is in the past.

11:03.800 --> 11:06.360
And the past cannot be changed.

11:16.680 --> 11:17.190
Zhu Yu.

11:19.310 --> 11:20.600
I have another question for you.

11:21.510 --> 11:23.360
Why did I grow up in the Yujie Hub?

11:38.310 --> 11:39.070
You're right.

11:40.390 --> 11:41.990
The Hengdao Sect had a deal with us,

11:42.480 --> 11:43.430
but they were still worried.

11:44.430 --> 11:46.390
They want to take the newborn lord
as a hostage

11:47.120 --> 11:49.240
to control the ruler
of the Sea of Clear Skies.

11:51.750 --> 11:53.280
Qi is just a hostage to you?

11:57.510 --> 11:58.040
What about me?

11:59.750 --> 12:01.240
Where is my memory?

12:01.680 --> 12:02.280
Yue.

12:03.430 --> 12:04.510
Your identity is secretive.

12:05.240 --> 12:06.310
If you go on,

12:07.040 --> 12:08.430
I fear you will be in danger.

12:08.990 --> 12:10.280
Why are you so persistent about it?

12:12.870 --> 12:13.750
Where is the Hengdao Sect?

12:15.560 --> 12:16.120
I don't know.

12:17.190 --> 12:18.240
Ge Qingfei, the Second Leader

12:18.560 --> 12:20.600
of the Hengdao Sect has been
in contact with us.

12:22.630 --> 12:23.070
Okay.

12:24.390 --> 12:24.950
I'll find a way

12:26.430 --> 12:27.560
if you won't tell me.

12:49.120 --> 12:49.830
Turns out

12:51.280 --> 12:52.920
for the Hengdao Sect,

12:54.870 --> 12:57.040
I am nothing more than a hostage
to threaten you.

12:58.480 --> 12:58.830
I...

12:59.750 --> 13:01.160
Those happy days

13:02.560 --> 13:03.990
were nothing but an illusion.

13:05.480 --> 13:06.310
What about Jinzhao?

13:07.560 --> 13:09.160
What is he to do with the Yujie Hub?

13:13.870 --> 13:14.310
Qi.

13:15.630 --> 13:16.560
Stop asking.

13:17.630 --> 13:20.120
I don't want the truth to hurt you.

13:20.430 --> 13:22.280
- Stop asking.
- I can bear it.

13:23.600 --> 13:24.040
Zhu Yu.

13:25.630 --> 13:26.830
To me, Jinzhao is the person

13:27.560 --> 13:29.510
I care about the most in this world.

13:30.240 --> 13:33.600
Why do you always hide things
and deceive me about him?

13:45.480 --> 13:47.390
You don't want to tell me, right?

13:53.950 --> 13:54.510
Fine.

13:56.280 --> 13:57.070
If you won't tell me,

13:58.560 --> 13:59.560
I will find a way myself.

14:38.630 --> 14:41.390
Will I have a chance

14:42.160 --> 14:43.870
to see Miss Shuo Xuan again?

14:51.390 --> 14:52.280
Miss Shuo Xuan.

14:52.800 --> 14:53.480
What are you doing?

14:54.390 --> 14:55.870
I'm waiting for Little Yue.

14:57.160 --> 14:57.750
She's also here.

14:58.830 --> 14:59.510
Miss Shuo Xuan.

15:00.510 --> 15:01.160
Well,

15:01.560 --> 15:03.070
I apologize to you.

15:03.430 --> 15:04.920
I no longer eat fish now.

15:08.240 --> 15:08.870
Miss Shuo Xuan.

15:11.280 --> 15:13.310
Is there anything else?

15:14.870 --> 15:15.480
I...

15:19.510 --> 15:21.990
Last time I bragged to you
about becoming a hero.

15:22.480 --> 15:23.560
Just forget it.

15:24.280 --> 15:25.240
Right now,

15:26.430 --> 15:28.280
I no longer want to be a hero.

15:30.190 --> 15:32.390
What happened?

15:32.480 --> 15:34.120
What makes you self-aware?

15:38.430 --> 15:39.390
A few days ago,

15:40.160 --> 15:41.720
a very kind senior died

15:42.360 --> 15:43.360
because of me.

15:46.280 --> 15:46.750
Before that,

15:47.830 --> 15:49.160
I always told myself

15:49.510 --> 15:51.630
that I must be a great hero.

15:52.920 --> 15:55.720
Yet, the emergence of a hero

15:56.040 --> 15:58.360
often comes with many casualties.

15:59.280 --> 16:00.120
So what?

16:00.510 --> 16:01.800
They aren't strong enough.

16:02.360 --> 16:03.630
Otherwise, they will become heroes.

16:04.390 --> 16:05.830
That's not right.

16:06.750 --> 16:09.280
If being a great hero needs

16:09.280 --> 16:10.630
to sacrifice many lives,

16:10.750 --> 16:12.870
I will give up being a hero.

16:22.310 --> 16:23.390
You are strange.

16:24.390 --> 16:25.280
Miss Shuo Xuan.

16:26.720 --> 16:29.600
The Luban lock I gave you...

16:30.070 --> 16:30.750
I've thrown it away.

16:37.360 --> 16:37.950
Shifang.

16:39.040 --> 16:39.680
Stop watching.

16:40.560 --> 16:41.310
She's left.

16:44.830 --> 16:45.800
Every time you see her,

16:45.920 --> 16:46.990
she's mean to you.

16:47.990 --> 16:49.120
Why do you like her?

16:52.870 --> 16:54.190
Miss Shuo Xuan...

16:55.240 --> 16:57.040
Seems like she's never confused.

16:58.070 --> 16:59.510
She always walks straight ahead,

17:00.510 --> 17:01.830
completely different from me.

17:03.680 --> 17:04.390
She's dazzling.

17:28.680 --> 17:29.240
Hey.

17:31.510 --> 17:33.430
Are you interested in that guy?

17:33.720 --> 17:34.560
Don't be silly.

17:39.630 --> 17:40.240
However,

17:40.800 --> 17:41.750
what are they here for?

17:43.360 --> 17:45.600
They must have guessed our relationship
with the Hengdao Sect.

17:45.750 --> 17:46.680
They came to verify it.

17:47.630 --> 17:48.800
So, what did you tell them?

17:49.830 --> 17:51.830
I didn't say what should not be said.

18:07.990 --> 18:09.160
What is this feeling?

18:14.680 --> 18:17.310
It's even more painful
than absorbing the Qiyuan Orb.

18:39.430 --> 18:39.920
Your Lordship.

18:41.510 --> 18:42.990
The young lord sent these pastries.

18:46.640 --> 18:48.840
(A taste of Mom)

18:54.470 --> 18:55.590
A taste of Mom.

19:01.630 --> 19:02.840
According to her friends,

19:03.560 --> 19:06.320
these are her favorite
in the Mortal Realm.

19:17.920 --> 19:18.840
My sense of taste

19:20.230 --> 19:21.560
has almost disappeared.

19:28.110 --> 19:30.960
If Qi finds it good,
it must be good, I guess.

19:42.710 --> 19:43.350
Your Lordship.

19:44.800 --> 19:46.280
The young lord has regained her memory.

19:48.510 --> 19:49.320
Before long,

19:50.990 --> 19:52.160
she will know the truth.

19:54.710 --> 19:56.710
I fear she can't handle the truth.

19:58.200 --> 19:59.960
She also consumed the Qiyuan Orb.

20:02.680 --> 20:04.350
Why hasn't she been consumed

20:05.040 --> 20:06.990
by the dark emotions of humans like me?

20:07.920 --> 20:08.920
Compared to Your Lordship,

20:10.280 --> 20:12.960
the young lord consumed
much fewer Qiyuan Orbs.

20:15.920 --> 20:16.440
Besides,

20:18.630 --> 20:19.280
Your Lordship,

20:20.750 --> 20:21.870
you are too lonely

20:23.870 --> 20:24.800
and tired.

20:29.710 --> 20:30.870
Why does she have to leave?

20:31.510 --> 20:33.200
Why is she unwilling to stay by my side?

20:34.110 --> 20:34.630
Your Lordship.

20:38.440 --> 20:38.960
Why?

20:40.160 --> 20:40.840
Why?

20:43.750 --> 20:44.280
Complaint.

20:46.350 --> 20:47.040
Resentment.

20:47.840 --> 20:48.560
Jealousness.

20:49.590 --> 20:50.510
Greediness.

20:50.920 --> 20:51.440
Your Lordship.

20:51.750 --> 20:53.560
These dark human emotions

20:54.470 --> 20:56.710
torment me incessantly.

20:57.040 --> 20:57.680
Your Lordship!

20:58.470 --> 20:59.800
I'm losing control.

21:00.750 --> 21:02.470
I'm losing control.

21:02.710 --> 21:03.280
Your Lordship!

21:04.160 --> 21:05.590
Your Lordship!

21:05.920 --> 21:06.470
Your Lordship!

21:06.710 --> 21:07.840
Your Lordship, calm down!

21:11.230 --> 21:11.990
Selfishness.

21:13.560 --> 21:14.440
Greediness.

21:16.470 --> 21:17.280
Complaint.

21:18.870 --> 21:19.840
Resentment.

21:21.590 --> 21:22.710
Pains.

21:33.080 --> 21:33.440
Shuo Xuan.

21:34.080 --> 21:36.440
We're different from humans.

21:36.870 --> 21:37.390
So...

21:39.510 --> 21:39.870
Darn it.

21:46.800 --> 21:47.470
Your Lordship!

21:49.750 --> 21:50.280
Your Lordship!

21:51.800 --> 21:52.160
Stop.

21:58.870 --> 21:59.510
Shuo Xuan.

22:13.280 --> 22:13.920
Your Lordship!

22:39.800 --> 22:40.510
Your Lordship.

22:40.990 --> 22:41.590
Your Lordship.

22:44.040 --> 22:44.990
Your Lordship!

22:45.920 --> 22:46.680
Xi Luo.

22:47.590 --> 22:49.390
Lin Yuan.

22:50.590 --> 22:51.200
Help!

22:52.920 --> 22:53.680
Save me.

22:58.110 --> 22:58.680
Shuo Xuan.

23:00.440 --> 23:00.960
Shuo Xuan.

23:02.630 --> 23:03.110
Shuo Xuan.

23:04.470 --> 23:05.080
Shuo Xuan.

23:06.040 --> 23:06.560
Shuo Xuan.

23:18.590 --> 23:19.280
Shuo Xuan.

23:20.230 --> 23:21.920
Meditation Spell!

23:23.280 --> 23:25.350
Yes, use the Meditation Spell.

23:34.870 --> 23:35.510
Your Lordship!

23:59.750 --> 24:00.440
Shuo Xuan.

24:43.960 --> 24:44.560
Your Lordship.

24:45.870 --> 24:46.840
Don't blame yourself.

24:47.630 --> 24:49.320
Lin Yuan and Shuo Xuan are both fine.

24:50.390 --> 24:51.750
Luckily, Shuo Xuan

24:52.800 --> 24:53.630
has also learned

24:54.200 --> 24:56.440
the Meditation Spell
that every queen must master.

24:58.110 --> 24:58.840
Mother.

25:08.590 --> 25:09.350
Back then,

25:12.110 --> 25:13.320
your mother, Ling Ye,

25:14.590 --> 25:16.280
used the Meditation Spell

25:17.840 --> 25:19.230
to connect my consciousness.

25:22.440 --> 25:23.680
Through her eyes,

25:25.110 --> 25:26.920
I saw the joys and sorrows
of the Yu Clan.

25:30.110 --> 25:32.110
In fact, I have always been aware
of her existence.

25:34.840 --> 25:36.160
But I never suspected it.

25:36.440 --> 25:37.710
I thought it was just a dream.

25:40.680 --> 25:41.680
Until one day,

25:43.280 --> 25:45.230
my consciousness became warmer.

25:46.840 --> 25:48.680
I couldn't help but get closer.

25:53.230 --> 25:54.040
That day,

25:56.750 --> 25:58.390
your mother gave birth to you.

26:06.960 --> 26:07.750
Good girl.

26:10.590 --> 26:11.840
You did very well.

26:13.680 --> 26:16.350
You have inherited the spiritual power
of the Yu Clan queens.

26:17.230 --> 26:20.630
Now, you've mastered
the Meditation Spell.

26:23.800 --> 26:24.390
Get up.

26:34.750 --> 26:35.680
Good girl.

26:36.920 --> 26:37.960
You are the future queen

26:39.200 --> 26:40.470
of the Yu Clan.

26:48.440 --> 26:49.110
Your Lordship.

26:49.990 --> 26:53.160
To me, you are my mother.

26:53.800 --> 26:55.960
I will always be by your side.

27:46.440 --> 27:47.710
Qi, what's wrong?

27:48.990 --> 27:49.440
Nothing.

27:50.200 --> 27:51.750
I suddenly feel a bit unwell.

28:15.840 --> 28:18.040
Ming Xiu, I'm sorry.

28:18.840 --> 28:19.750
Turns out Zhu Yu

28:19.750 --> 28:21.560
is the Lord Ming we've been looking for.

28:23.390 --> 28:24.560
No need to apologize, Miss Yue.

28:24.960 --> 28:25.920
This is not your fault.

28:27.560 --> 28:28.320
That's right.

28:29.840 --> 28:31.080
Little Yue is also a victim.

28:39.080 --> 28:41.040
I have found my origins and memories.

28:41.710 --> 28:42.840
As for Jinzhao,

28:43.470 --> 28:45.280
Zhu Yu said the truth is cruel to me.

28:45.710 --> 28:47.200
She refused to tell me anything.

28:48.040 --> 28:48.920
So did Lin Yuan.

28:49.440 --> 28:51.630
He said the investigation
would endanger his life.

28:53.960 --> 28:56.350
Yue, what should we do next?

29:00.390 --> 29:02.800
I can't entirely trust Zhu Yu
and Lin Yuan.

29:04.680 --> 29:06.230
The closer I get to the truth
of my origins,

29:06.800 --> 29:07.630
the more dangerous it is.

29:09.710 --> 29:11.040
I have been searching for my origins,

29:12.680 --> 29:14.960
And I'm not afraid of any dangers.

29:16.280 --> 29:16.870
But you guys

29:18.320 --> 29:19.800
don't have to take the risk with me.

29:21.920 --> 29:22.390
So...

29:24.200 --> 29:25.590
Jinzhao, what's wrong with you?

29:25.590 --> 29:26.800
So why are you being foolish?

29:28.200 --> 29:28.870
Yes.

29:29.390 --> 29:30.350
We've come this far.

29:30.800 --> 29:31.710
We should act together.

29:33.840 --> 29:35.160
We have shared life and death.

29:35.230 --> 29:36.510
Don't be a loon.

29:39.560 --> 29:41.350
Lin Yuan refused
to tell us where the Hengdao Sect is.

29:43.750 --> 29:45.870
Little Yue, you grew up
in the Hengdao Sect.

29:46.280 --> 29:47.590
Do you know where it is?

29:49.350 --> 29:51.470
I only remember something
called the Yujie Hub.

29:51.750 --> 29:53.110
It's a city in the sky.

29:56.230 --> 29:58.750
Let's find a way to locate it.

30:05.280 --> 30:06.280
The Qiyuan Orb

30:07.560 --> 30:08.590
no longer satisfies me.

30:12.750 --> 30:14.230
When I promised Ying Xuwei

30:15.160 --> 30:17.440
to accept the Vitality Energy
from the Qiyuan Orb,

30:18.390 --> 30:19.510
I realized

30:20.440 --> 30:21.440
that sooner or later,

30:22.840 --> 30:25.470
I would be lost
in the dark human emotions.

30:26.710 --> 30:27.710
But I can't stand it.

30:28.960 --> 30:30.590
I'm not willing to suffer.

30:32.040 --> 30:34.280
I want to enjoy a happy time
with my daughter.

30:38.200 --> 30:38.750
Your Lordship.

30:40.710 --> 30:41.680
News from the Mortal Realm.

30:42.110 --> 30:43.230
The Luo family

30:43.590 --> 30:45.280
is auctioning a gemstone called Rehai.

30:46.710 --> 30:48.510
A few days ago, a scout sent a message.

30:49.110 --> 30:51.470
Ying Xuwei sent people
to find out about the auction.

30:52.320 --> 30:53.840
However, the progress is still unknown.

30:54.750 --> 30:55.630
Bian Luohuan once fell

30:56.110 --> 30:57.560
into the hands of the Luo family before.

30:58.160 --> 30:58.960
In that case,

30:59.710 --> 31:01.510
the Hengdao Sect has a connection
with the Luo family.

31:05.680 --> 31:08.040
What if the Luo family spread the word

31:08.750 --> 31:10.160
just to lure Your Lordship there?

31:13.350 --> 31:14.280
I have nothing to fear.

31:15.510 --> 31:17.230
I will go with you.

31:44.440 --> 31:45.080
Jinzhao.

31:45.870 --> 31:47.710
Jinzhao, your eye is uncomfortable?

31:54.080 --> 31:54.590
This is...

31:59.590 --> 32:00.390
Like Pureness,

32:00.840 --> 32:01.590
my left eye can also

32:02.160 --> 32:03.320
see visions of the future.

32:04.800 --> 32:05.960
When I woke up three years ago,

32:06.110 --> 32:07.110
my left eye became like this.

32:09.080 --> 32:10.440
Every time I see visions of the future,

32:11.160 --> 32:12.560
my eye suffers unbearable pain.

32:15.160 --> 32:16.710
If there is any danger coming,

32:16.710 --> 32:18.230
or before something important happens,

32:18.680 --> 32:21.040
his left eye can foresee it in advance.

32:22.080 --> 32:22.560
Zhaoyan.

32:22.990 --> 32:24.710
Because of his left eye's guidance,

32:25.160 --> 32:26.870
we found you at the Yinghui Fort.

32:28.510 --> 32:30.230
Incredible.

32:31.990 --> 32:33.110
What did you just see?

32:35.230 --> 32:36.510
I saw Lang Mo, the one we saved

32:36.960 --> 32:37.990
in the Luori Village

32:38.840 --> 32:40.870
and the little girl swinging hammers
at the Fengyan Inn.

32:42.440 --> 32:45.440
Previously, I no longer believed
in the prophecies of my left eye.

32:46.590 --> 32:47.110
But...

32:48.710 --> 32:50.510
Yue, if Lang Mo is in trouble,

32:50.590 --> 32:51.920
we still have to help him.

32:52.470 --> 32:52.840
Yeah.

32:59.440 --> 33:01.040
I must go and ask Bian Luohuan

33:01.840 --> 33:03.510
about the purpose of the Yujie Hub.

33:03.710 --> 33:06.630
And what exactly is the relationship
between you two?

33:07.280 --> 33:08.200
I do not believe

33:08.200 --> 33:09.710
that you are twin brothers.

33:10.750 --> 33:11.040
Exactly.

33:12.590 --> 33:12.990
Okay.

33:13.840 --> 33:15.110
I'll find a disciple of the Luo family

33:15.320 --> 33:16.390
and search for Lang Mo.

33:25.230 --> 33:27.280
Just now, Zhu Yu left
the Sea of Clear Skies

33:27.630 --> 33:28.750
with Shuo Xuan.

33:30.680 --> 33:31.990
They're heading to the Luo Mansion.

33:32.840 --> 33:35.510
It seems that the message
we sent to Lin Yuan

33:35.840 --> 33:36.750
has started to work.

33:37.710 --> 33:40.510
Now that Zhu Yu has begun
to covet the power of Rehai,

33:41.280 --> 33:44.960
that means she is not far
from going completely mad.

33:48.440 --> 33:50.560
We are bound to have a battle
with the Sea of Clear Skies.

33:51.630 --> 33:56.080
It's time to bring Qi
and Yue Jinzhao back to the Yujie Hub.

34:18.199 --> 34:18.960
Mr. Luo.

34:20.469 --> 34:22.920
I guess you've been waiting
for my message.

34:24.469 --> 34:26.469
Zhu Yu has headed to the Luo Mansion.

34:27.560 --> 34:29.560
Today, Mr. Luo has to put on an act

34:29.800 --> 34:30.960
with me.

34:33.840 --> 34:35.280
Yue Jinzhao and his company

34:35.350 --> 34:38.510
have gone to the Mangwan Village
to look for Lang Mo.

34:39.630 --> 34:40.469
Thanks for telling me.

34:41.679 --> 34:43.440
Before the grand family ceremony,

34:44.110 --> 34:46.560
I don't want Zhaoyan to be there.

34:49.560 --> 34:51.560
I will send someone to hold her back.

34:52.469 --> 34:54.159
I'll wait for your good news.

34:57.160 --> 34:59.630
Qingfei, I'll go to the Luo Mansion.

35:00.350 --> 35:02.200
You go to the Mangwan Village
and restrain Luo Zhaoyan.

35:02.840 --> 35:05.040
Bring Qi and Yue Jinzhao
back to the Yujie Hub.

35:05.750 --> 35:06.200
Xuwei.

35:25.870 --> 35:28.080
It's almost the time.

35:31.320 --> 35:32.440
I don't have much time left.

35:34.350 --> 35:35.750
It's my responsibility
to bring them back.

35:36.990 --> 35:39.870
Moreover, it seems
Qi has regained her memory.

35:41.280 --> 35:41.960
I want to see her.

35:43.110 --> 35:45.440
Huan, don't be silly.

35:48.710 --> 35:49.560
Brother, sister.

35:51.670 --> 35:52.710
I will go with Luohuan.

35:58.710 --> 35:59.190
Alright.

35:59.840 --> 36:00.230
Xuwei.

36:01.280 --> 36:02.910
If Huan insists on going,

36:03.190 --> 36:04.670
why not let Xiaoyuan accompany him?

36:05.230 --> 36:06.190
With Xiaoyuan's protection,

36:06.430 --> 36:07.670
we can be less worried.

36:08.360 --> 36:08.950
What do you say?

36:09.230 --> 36:10.710
Xuwei, I can do it.

36:14.430 --> 36:16.750
It's important to complete the mission.

36:18.750 --> 36:19.840
Keep Luohuan safe.

36:20.710 --> 36:21.470
No worries.

36:22.230 --> 36:23.670
I will protect Luohuan.

36:41.190 --> 36:41.670
Let's set out.

37:04.670 --> 37:05.280
Cang Feng.

37:06.560 --> 37:07.510
Get ready for guests.

37:07.750 --> 37:08.800
Make two cups of tea.

37:09.230 --> 37:09.670
Yes.

37:09.990 --> 37:10.360
Wait.

37:14.510 --> 37:15.280
Three cups.

37:52.030 --> 37:55.710
♪A meteor streaking across the sky♪

37:57.060 --> 37:59.620
♪Burns what once was♪

38:01.150 --> 38:03.980
♪The name is forgotten♪

38:08.060 --> 38:11.580
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

38:12.990 --> 38:16.020
♪Only through the eyes♪

38:16.900 --> 38:19.940
♪Who can see them clearly♪

38:22.110 --> 38:28.150
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

38:29.860 --> 38:36.220
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

38:38.080 --> 38:45.570
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

38:46.120 --> 38:52.610
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

39:10.050 --> 39:14.030
♪The seemingly random paths♪

39:15.070 --> 39:17.930
♪The burning traces♪

39:19.010 --> 39:22.980
♪Behind them are all secrets♪

39:26.110 --> 39:30.410
♪Those unexpected encounters♪

39:31.040 --> 39:34.320
♪Are all carefully♪

39:35.100 --> 39:38.560
♪Arranged by me♪

39:40.030 --> 39:46.980
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

39:48.030 --> 39:55.010
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

39:56.030 --> 40:03.620
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

40:04.130 --> 40:11.300
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

40:11.780 --> 40:19.560
♪I'm destined to give my all for you♪

40:20.030 --> 40:27.580
♪Even if my efforts may go up in smoke♪

40:27.970 --> 40:36.050
♪I am madly in love with you
and will do everything for you♪

40:36.050 --> 40:44.190
♪Leaving behind proof of my love♪
